			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update Rust dependencies to latest versions\n\nBump multiple dependencies in Grove to their latest stable versions:\n- wasmtime: 42 → 44 (WASM runtime)\n- wasmtime-wasi: 42 → 44 (WASI support)\n- wasmparser: 0.245 → 0.247 (WASM parsing)\n- prost: 0.12 → 0.14 (Protocol buffers)\n- tonic: 0.12 → 0.14 (gRPC framework)\n- tonic-build: 0.12 → 0.14 (code generation)\n- vergen: 8 → 9 (build metadata)\n\nThese updates bring bug fixes, performance improvements, and API compatibility between the core WASM runtime and gRPC components used by the Grove extension host.",
